## What is and is not covered

The underlying expenditure figures are public records of the Government of
India and are not the subject of any copyright claim by this project. What this
licence covers is the work done on top of them: the purpose taxonomy, the
hierarchical arrangement, the identifiers, the reconciliation, and the
provenance records.

Source documents downloaded into `sources/cache/` are Government of India
publications and are not covered by this licence. They are not distributed with
this package.

